Description: Remove the call-home to the vendor licence portal
 PUT /system/license/creds used to POST entered subscription credentials to the
 vendor licence portal to download a licence certificate. Office Unbound needs
 no licence and must not send credentials to a third party, so the request is
 removed; credentials (if an admin still enters any) are only stored locally.
Author: Office Unbound
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-15

